WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.312
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.582 --> 00:11.974
[Episode 11]

3
00:21.079 --> 00:22.440
Meng Yuan Xiong.

4
00:22.440 --> 00:24.199
Taiji.

5
01:02.784 --> 01:05.726
[Zhuo Zhi Xuan]

6
01:11.719 --> 01:14.040
I need you to do me a favor.

7
01:17.840 --> 01:20.280
Why is it her again?

8
01:20.280 --> 01:21.560
Back then, you didn't accept the offer letter

9
01:21.560 --> 01:24.000
because she gambled away all the money.

10
01:24.000 --> 01:25.760
You couldn't see Zhao Sheng Ge off

11
01:25.760 --> 01:27.239
because of her gambling, too.

12
01:27.239 --> 01:29.000
Then you got locked up because of her.

13
01:29.000 --> 01:30.280
And now, it's her again.

14
01:30.280 --> 01:32.840
How can you stay so calm?

15
01:33.840 --> 01:35.840
She's always dragging you down.

16
01:35.840 --> 01:37.640
She even affected Kexiang's development.

17
01:37.640 --> 01:38.719
Can't you just be firm for once?

18
01:38.719 --> 01:40.480
Xuan.

19
01:43.319 --> 01:46.040
She saved me from Mount Xiaolan.

20
01:46.040 --> 01:48.400
Don't be afraid, Mommy's here.

21
01:48.400 --> 01:50.480
Mommy's here.

22
01:51.560 --> 01:52.987
So, what do we do now?

23
01:53.879 --> 01:56.719
I have a rough idea of what they're up to.

24
01:56.719 --> 01:58.599
I just checked Rongxin's stock price.

25
01:58.599 --> 02:00.040
It's a bit inflated.

26
02:00.040 --> 02:03.358
I suspect Taiji is setting a trap to short Rongxin.

27
02:04.280 --> 02:06.560
Then who sent you that message?

28
02:06.560 --> 02:08.560
I don't know.

29
02:08.560 --> 02:11.000
But I have a plan.

30
02:11.639 --> 02:13.360
I need your help.

31
02:14.719 --> 02:17.319
Another plan?

32
02:28.000 --> 02:29.520
Think this through.

33
02:29.520 --> 02:32.879
Are you sure you want to do this behind Zhao Sheng Ge's back?

34
02:32.879 --> 02:35.258
If he finds out,

35
02:35.258 --> 02:37.560
he'll kill you.

36
02:38.199 --> 02:40.360
He'll kill me, too.

37
02:46.240 --> 02:48.479
Then so be it.

38
02:48.479 --> 02:51.439
Tell me what to do, and I'll do it.

39
02:53.680 --> 02:58.599
But have you updated your sticker collection?

40
02:58.599 --> 03:00.960
Can you send me some more?

41
03:13.959 --> 03:15.039
Hello, darling.

42
03:15.039 --> 03:16.919
Can you come home tomorrow?

43
03:16.919 --> 03:18.879
It's a family gathering.

44
03:18.879 --> 03:20.039
Okay.

45
03:20.039 --> 03:22.120
Okay, bye.

46
03:31.080 --> 03:32.960
Hello, Young Master.

47
03:35.159 --> 03:36.879
Fourth Young Master.

48
03:37.960 --> 03:39.360
Wan, look at you.

49
03:39.360 --> 03:41.319
Coming home in a new car.

50
03:41.319 --> 03:42.879
Darling, you're back.

51
03:42.879 --> 03:43.879
How have you been lately?

52
03:43.879 --> 03:45.039
Are you doing okay?

53
03:45.039 --> 03:46.539
Look.

54
03:48.719 --> 03:51.240
What do you want me to do?

55
03:51.240 --> 03:53.000
They're all fighting for power.

56
03:53.000 --> 03:54.599
And you won't help me.

57
03:54.599 --> 03:57.439
I had no choice but to go to him.

58
04:08.759 --> 04:10.639
Darling, you haven't been home for a long time.

59
04:10.639 --> 04:12.879
Go sit with your father.

60
04:12.879 --> 04:14.879
- Go on. - It's fine.

61
04:14.879 --> 04:16.839
I'll just stand here.

62
04:16.839 --> 04:19.560
Wan is the Prince's favorite right now.

63
04:19.560 --> 04:21.680
He doesn't have time to come home for dinner often.

64
04:21.680 --> 04:23.120
Isn't that the truth?

65
04:23.120 --> 04:24.399
That's not true.

66
04:24.399 --> 04:25.759
Mr. Zhao and I aren't close.

67
04:25.759 --> 04:28.120
It's just for Zhuo Zhi Xuan's sake.

68
04:28.120 --> 04:32.040
Wan, you're being too modest if you say that.

69
04:32.040 --> 04:34.480
I heard you went to Ting Island, right?

70
04:34.480 --> 04:36.519
Then you've done a great job protecting him.

71
04:36.519 --> 04:38.120
I went with a group of people.

72
04:38.120 --> 04:39.160
Indeed.

73
04:39.160 --> 04:42.079
Last time Wan took me to Tianhou Temple to pray to Mazu,

74
04:42.079 --> 04:44.279
Mr. Zhao even came over just to say hello.

75
04:44.279 --> 04:46.199
We chatted for quite a while.

76
04:46.199 --> 04:48.199
Mr. Zhao is really handsome.

77
04:48.199 --> 04:49.720
He's not intimidating at all.

78
04:49.720 --> 04:51.879
He's very polite to Wan.

79
04:51.879 --> 04:53.959
They've become so close.

80
04:53.959 --> 04:56.000
Wan is quite something now.

81
04:56.000 --> 04:57.120
He really is.

82
04:57.120 --> 04:58.639
Did everyone forget?

83
04:58.639 --> 05:00.759
That Feng Shui master a while back,

84
05:00.759 --> 05:02.920
with all that fire-breathing and rituals...

85
05:02.920 --> 05:05.159
Rongxin's stock price jumped several times over.

86
05:05.159 --> 05:06.519
Yes.

87
05:06.519 --> 05:08.920
I see the third missus is returning from her studies this year.

88
05:08.920 --> 05:11.839
I wonder if there are any eligible young men for her.

89
05:11.839 --> 05:13.120
Regarding that,

90
05:13.120 --> 05:15.360
does Eldest Sister have any good recommendations?

91
05:15.360 --> 05:17.480
You left it at my house.

92
05:17.480 --> 05:19.079
Can I pick you up today?

93
05:19.079 --> 05:21.120
Bring it to me then.

94
05:22.279 --> 05:24.839
The material is quite ordinary.

95
05:24.839 --> 05:27.199
Next time, I'll bring a ruby one.

96
05:27.199 --> 05:30.600
Wan, you really are a busy man now.

97
05:30.600 --> 05:33.600
You can't even put your phone down.

98
05:33.600 --> 05:35.439
That's not true.

99
05:35.439 --> 05:38.839
If we can get on board with Zhao Sheng Ge,

100
05:38.839 --> 05:41.639
we won't have to worry about a thing for the rest of our lives.

101
05:41.639 --> 05:43.560
That's right.

102
05:44.639 --> 05:46.160
Wan.

103
05:46.160 --> 05:47.959
Come to my study.

104
05:52.000 --> 05:53.519
Darling.

105
05:53.519 --> 05:55.160
Don't make your dad angry.

106
05:55.160 --> 05:57.279
Okay, I'm going.

107
05:58.000 --> 05:59.560
Mom.

108
05:59.560 --> 06:01.879
This tea is quite good.

109
06:08.759 --> 06:11.560
You haven't visited your mother much lately.

110
06:13.920 --> 06:14.920
I've been busy.

111
06:14.920 --> 06:16.720
I haven't had time.

112
06:17.519 --> 06:21.079
Qing Miao has a restless nature.

113
06:21.079 --> 06:22.279
She loves to gamble.

114
06:22.279 --> 06:23.519
She loves to have fun.

115
06:23.519 --> 06:25.160
If it weren't for me all these years,

116
06:25.160 --> 06:27.720
she wouldn't be living so comfortably.

117
06:27.720 --> 06:30.360
What do you want me to do for you?

118
06:32.879 --> 06:36.120
What do you mean by that?

119
06:36.120 --> 06:37.319
You should think about

120
06:37.319 --> 06:40.000
what you can do for this family.

121
06:40.000 --> 06:41.160
Chen Wan.

122
06:41.160 --> 06:43.439
I've raised you for over 20 years.

123
06:43.439 --> 06:45.199
Is this your attitude?

124
06:45.199 --> 06:48.439
Then you're giving me too much credit.

125
06:48.439 --> 06:50.199
You believe everything outsiders say.

126
06:50.199 --> 06:53.199
Zhuo Zhi Xuan has no power in the Zhuo family.

127
06:53.199 --> 06:54.800
Even the current Zhuo family

128
06:54.800 --> 06:58.160
has little influence over Zhao Sheng Ge.

129
06:59.040 --> 07:00.839
With your status,

130
07:00.839 --> 07:03.040
I didn't expect you to have a deep connection with him.

131
07:03.040 --> 07:05.800
However, regarding the Zhao's project you're working on,

132
07:05.800 --> 07:07.399
the two construction material sectors

133
07:07.399 --> 07:10.879
match your brother's new subsidiary well.

134
07:11.920 --> 07:13.759
Keep the profits within the family.

135
07:13.759 --> 07:15.480
Who is Zhao Sheng Ge?

136
07:15.480 --> 07:16.839
And who am I?

137
07:16.839 --> 07:18.519
How could I meddle in his business?

138
07:18.519 --> 07:20.920
I have no say in it.

139
07:23.600 --> 07:25.120
You think you're ready to fly on your own.

140
07:25.120 --> 07:26.239
But your mother is still here.

141
07:26.239 --> 07:27.839
Where can you possibly go?

142
07:27.839 --> 07:30.800
She's been with me since before she was 20.

143
07:30.800 --> 07:33.439
I hold every detail of her life in the palm of my hand.

144
07:33.439 --> 07:34.839
If you really care about her,

145
07:34.839 --> 07:36.000
don't defy me or play games with me.

146
07:36.000 --> 07:38.199
Don't try to play me for a fool.

147
07:38.199 --> 07:41.600
If... what happened with you and her when you were young gets out,

148
07:41.600 --> 07:44.120
forget about Zhao Sheng Ge cooperating with you.

149
07:44.120 --> 07:45.800
Even in Hai City,

150
07:45.800 --> 07:48.319
there will be no place for you to survive.

151
07:48.319 --> 07:50.560
Fine. Then I want shares.

152
07:50.560 --> 07:53.160
You gave shares to every other branch.

153
07:53.160 --> 07:54.800
If you want me to work for you,

154
07:54.800 --> 07:57.319
you have to give me something in return.

155
07:59.839 --> 08:01.519
You're asking for too much.

156
08:01.519 --> 08:03.240
If you don't give me anything,

157
08:03.240 --> 08:04.639
how can I work for you?

158
08:04.639 --> 08:06.000
Fine.

159
08:06.000 --> 08:08.079
I'll give you two percent first.

160
08:08.079 --> 08:09.639
The rest depends on your performance.

161
08:09.639 --> 08:11.920
But don't try to play games with me.

162
08:11.920 --> 08:15.160
Your tricks are things I mastered years ago.

163
08:15.160 --> 08:17.199
No matter how much you hate me,

164
08:17.199 --> 08:19.160
we're still family.

165
08:19.160 --> 08:21.720
As long as you're in Hai City,

166
08:21.720 --> 08:22.840
you'll never get rid of the name Chen.

167
08:22.840 --> 08:25.160
When will the shares be transferred?

168
08:28.079 --> 08:29.680
You're just like your mother.

169
08:29.680 --> 08:31.920
You're so obsessed with money.

170
08:31.920 --> 08:33.159
When?

171
08:33.159 --> 08:35.919
- You... - Payment first, then I'll do the job.

172
08:35.919 --> 08:39.840
I'm sure you know how this works, Mr. Chen.

173
08:42.720 --> 08:44.440
You ungrateful son.

174
09:09.000 --> 09:11.320
If what happened with you and her when you were young gets out,

175
09:11.320 --> 09:13.919
forget about Zhao Sheng Ge cooperating with you.

176
09:13.919 --> 09:15.159
Even in Hai City,

177
09:15.159 --> 09:17.480
there will be no place for you to survive.

178
10:07.759 --> 10:09.279
It's fixed.

179
10:09.279 --> 10:11.120
It wasn't hard.

180
10:16.837 --> 10:20.291
[I'll pick you up now]

181
10:21.879 --> 10:23.833
I can't have dinner with you today.

182
10:24.720 --> 10:26.399
I have a date.

183
10:27.000 --> 10:28.080
How mysterious.

184
10:28.080 --> 10:29.679
There's nothing mysterious about it.

185
10:29.679 --> 10:32.000
I'm still getting to know him.

186
10:32.000 --> 10:33.600
Not only do I have to know him,

187
10:33.600 --> 10:35.559
I also need to know his family.

188
10:35.559 --> 10:37.399
Or his assets.

189
10:37.399 --> 10:39.000
The Chen family has fallen.

190
10:39.000 --> 10:41.279
Chen Bing Xin won't accept defeat.

191
10:41.279 --> 10:45.159
Besides, the Chen family will face a big storm soon.

192
10:45.159 --> 10:46.559
You have to be prepared.

193
10:46.559 --> 10:47.799
I won't do anything.

194
10:47.799 --> 10:49.679
You only know part of the story.

195
10:49.679 --> 10:52.639
But I've sent him an anonymous message.

196
10:52.639 --> 10:55.039
He should know by now.

197
10:55.039 --> 10:58.799
Do you want to see what he'll do?

198
10:58.799 --> 11:00.679
I want to help him.

199
11:25.919 --> 11:27.799
Aren't you going to leave them in the car?

200
11:27.799 --> 11:30.080
Flowers are meant to be seen.

201
11:30.080 --> 11:31.561
Okay.

202
11:32.799 --> 11:34.360
Why are you giving me flowers again?

203
11:34.360 --> 11:36.159
Because I'm still pursuing you.

204
11:36.159 --> 11:39.080
I'm afraid you'll forget me when we're apart.

205
11:40.279 --> 11:42.039
So, you do know.

206
11:42.039 --> 11:43.440
Back in school,

207
11:43.440 --> 11:46.559
when my classmates went on dates,

208
11:46.559 --> 11:48.720
they'd start by giving flowers.

209
11:48.720 --> 11:50.799
Then they'd take them out to dinner.

210
11:50.799 --> 11:52.519
So, where are you taking me?

211
11:52.519 --> 11:55.639
I booked a well-reviewed restaurant.

212
11:55.639 --> 11:56.720
Let's go try it.

213
11:56.720 --> 11:58.959
Sure.

214
11:58.959 --> 11:59.959
Thank you.

215
11:59.959 --> 12:02.000
Grilled octopus with mushrooms. Enjoy your meal.

216
12:02.000 --> 12:03.159
Thanks.

217
12:03.159 --> 12:07.232
Sir, pan-fried sea bass with scallops. Enjoy your meal.

218
12:08.440 --> 12:10.279
This is their signature sea bass.

219
12:10.279 --> 12:11.480
I ordered it in advance.

220
12:11.480 --> 12:12.480
Try it.

221
12:12.480 --> 12:13.759
Chen Wan.

222
12:13.759 --> 12:15.240
Haven't you been getting any rest?

223
12:15.240 --> 12:16.919
The dark circles under your eyes are heavy.

224
12:16.919 --> 12:18.200
Are they?

225
12:18.200 --> 12:19.519
I guess they are a little.

226
12:19.519 --> 12:23.320
Well, I have to work hard to earn money to pursue you.

227
12:23.320 --> 12:26.600
Chen Wan, pursuing me doesn't have to be expensive.

228
12:26.600 --> 12:27.639
It does.

229
12:27.639 --> 12:29.399
It takes a lot.

230
12:29.399 --> 12:34.555
Zhao Sheng Ge, my pursuit of you is never just talk.

231
12:36.039 --> 12:38.480
I know you have everything you need,

232
12:38.480 --> 12:40.600
but I still want to give you the best.

233
12:40.600 --> 12:42.879
It's what I should do.

234
12:42.879 --> 12:44.799
Chen Wan.

235
12:44.799 --> 12:47.879
It's okay if you don't like or need it, Zhao Sheng Ge.

236
12:47.879 --> 12:50.720
But I will do everything I can for you.

237
12:50.720 --> 12:52.579
I must do so.

238
12:53.679 --> 12:55.080
The mistake I made when you were sick,

239
12:55.080 --> 12:57.440
I won't make it again.

240
12:58.919 --> 13:02.409
I've actually wanted to apologize for that for a long time.

241
13:03.519 --> 13:06.480
I didn't bring you the medicine then because...

242
13:06.480 --> 13:08.440
I was worried you'd find it intrusive.

243
13:08.440 --> 13:09.960
But after I hung up,

244
13:09.960 --> 13:12.120
I couldn't sleep all night.

245
13:12.120 --> 13:13.559
I was worried you had a fever,

246
13:13.559 --> 13:15.440
and that you didn't have any medicine.

247
13:15.440 --> 13:17.159
I won't let it happen again.

248
13:17.159 --> 13:18.960
I'm not saying this

249
13:18.960 --> 13:21.920
just to get you to accept my pursuit.

250
13:22.879 --> 13:26.086
But I... forgave you a long time ago.

251
13:27.200 --> 13:28.240
That day we went bowling,

252
13:28.240 --> 13:30.679
you didn't seem to pay much attention to me.

253
13:30.679 --> 13:33.240
I was so worried you hated me.

254
13:34.679 --> 13:36.279
Is it because I bowled a "Christmas tree"

255
13:36.279 --> 13:37.399
that you forgave me?

256
13:37.399 --> 13:38.720
What do you think?

257
13:38.720 --> 13:40.799
I suppose so.

258
13:43.039 --> 13:44.829
Then, Zhao Sheng Ge...

259
13:44.829 --> 13:45.840
From now on,

260
13:45.840 --> 13:48.399
if I ever do something to make you angry,

261
13:48.399 --> 13:50.120
I'll bowl a "Christmas tree" for you.

262
13:50.120 --> 13:52.039
If I do that, will you forgive me?

263
13:52.039 --> 13:54.440
Are you saying there will be a next time?

264
13:54.440 --> 13:57.200
I'm just saying "if."

265
13:57.200 --> 14:00.240
But even if you don't forgive me, I'll still do it.

266
14:00.240 --> 14:05.323
After all, I just want you to be happy.

267
14:06.019 --> 14:07.611
Chen Wan.

268
14:07.611 --> 14:09.121
Why?

269
14:09.826 --> 14:11.915
What do you like about me?

270
14:12.812 --> 14:14.958
Who wouldn't like you, Zhao Sheng Ge?

271
14:14.958 --> 14:16.547
I think, rationally speaking,

272
14:16.547 --> 14:18.753
you should disenchant yourself with me.

273
14:18.753 --> 14:20.340
Disenchant?

274
14:22.099 --> 14:24.904
We've spent some time together now.

275
14:24.904 --> 14:27.253
During this time, you must have noticed

276
14:27.253 --> 14:29.000
that if you strip away my status,

277
14:29.000 --> 14:31.573
the halo, and the fame,

278
14:31.573 --> 14:33.526
I'm just an ordinary person.

279
14:33.526 --> 14:34.905
If my last name wasn't Zhao,

280
14:34.905 --> 14:37.895
maybe I'd just be a young man working 9-to-5,

281
14:37.895 --> 14:39.423
commuting on the subway every day.

282
14:39.423 --> 14:42.049
Or maybe I'd be an office worker overwhelmed

283
14:42.049 --> 14:44.551
by car loans and mortgages every day.

284
14:45.892 --> 14:47.277
I can squeeze into the subway.

285
14:47.277 --> 14:49.182
If you were to squeeze into the subway,

286
14:49.182 --> 14:51.501
we would have met there.

287
14:52.832 --> 14:54.457
Zhao Sheng Ge.

288
14:54.457 --> 14:57.617
You wouldn't be ordinary even on a subway.

289
15:10.220 --> 15:11.780
Let's go take a look.

290
15:11.780 --> 15:13.009
Sure.

291
15:44.340 --> 15:46.220
Wait for me a moment.

292
15:50.747 --> 15:52.299
- See which one you want to eat. - Hello.

293
15:52.299 --> 15:54.260
They're all delicious.

294
15:56.853 --> 15:58.220
Oh, a new audience member.

295
15:58.220 --> 16:00.175
Would you like to request a song?

296
16:01.699 --> 16:03.380
Take care. Come back if you like the food.

297
16:03.380 --> 16:06.579
I'd like this and this, please.

298
17:03.668 --> 17:06.359
After the Lychee Bay project is finished,

299
17:06.359 --> 17:08.799
the roadshow will begin.

300
17:08.799 --> 17:11.359
As for sponsors, do you have anyone in mind?

301
17:11.359 --> 17:14.079
The Tams, the Yaos, and Taiji

302
17:14.079 --> 17:16.160
have all expressed interest in collaborating.

303
17:16.160 --> 17:17.439
However, the Tam family

304
17:17.439 --> 17:20.120
already works closely with Minglong.

305
17:20.120 --> 17:22.640
It might not create much synergy.

306
17:22.640 --> 17:24.359
If you're asking me,

307
17:24.359 --> 17:26.680
maybe the Yao family would be better.

308
17:28.440 --> 17:29.880
I'm being serious.

309
17:29.880 --> 17:33.200
Xu Zhi Ying's recommendation to me was Taiji.

310
17:33.200 --> 17:34.640
They've shown a lot of sincerity.

311
17:34.640 --> 17:36.119
Taiji has foreign backing.

312
17:36.119 --> 17:37.160
That has its advantages,

313
17:37.160 --> 17:38.559
but also its disadvantages.

314
17:38.559 --> 17:39.759
In the previous quarter,

315
17:39.759 --> 17:41.519
they started quite a few projects.

316
17:41.519 --> 17:45.359
Last year, they acquired many small businesses.

317
17:45.359 --> 17:46.960
You should be cautious about bringing them in.

318
17:46.960 --> 17:49.759
But then again, this is just my personal opinion.

319
17:49.759 --> 17:52.839
You should still follow the advice of your risk assessment team.

320
17:52.839 --> 17:54.920
You're very well-informed.

321
17:54.920 --> 17:56.891
I saw it during the public announcement.

322
17:57.960 --> 17:59.799
I'll consider your opinion.

323
17:59.799 --> 18:02.279
The latest survey maps are in the folder.

324
18:02.279 --> 18:04.079
You can take a look.

325
18:08.200 --> 18:10.920
Sea Oil Tunnel No. 7.

326
18:10.920 --> 18:13.599
This tunnel hasn't been officially named yet.

327
18:13.599 --> 18:15.160
Do you have any ideas?

328
18:15.160 --> 18:16.759
The middle section of this tunnel

329
18:16.759 --> 18:20.240
crosses the world's largest ocean trench.

330
18:20.240 --> 18:22.880
It's heavily influenced by gravity,

331
18:22.880 --> 18:25.400
and the tides are strongly affected by the moon.

332
18:25.400 --> 18:29.000
In this location, the super golden moon can be seen

333
18:29.000 --> 18:32.039
more often than anywhere else in the world.

334
18:32.039 --> 18:34.117
I'd like to name it...

335
18:37.039 --> 18:39.063
the Full Moon Channel.

336
18:40.880 --> 18:42.680
That's a beautiful sentiment.

337
19:15.519 --> 19:17.680
Who knows how long we'll have to wait?

338
19:17.680 --> 19:19.601
Just be patient.

339
19:35.685 --> 19:37.326
You're awake.

340
19:39.039 --> 19:40.359
There's still time.

341
19:40.359 --> 19:42.047
Don't rush.

342
19:42.839 --> 19:44.359
Here.

343
19:44.359 --> 19:46.440
Zhao Sheng Ge, you don't have to do this.

344
19:47.446 --> 19:49.005
Let me.

345
20:12.480 --> 20:14.480
All of this...

346
20:14.480 --> 20:16.880
can only be seen by me.

347
20:23.119 --> 20:24.440
We'll be late.

348
20:24.440 --> 20:25.940
Let's go.

349
20:26.720 --> 20:28.480
Mr. Zhao, regarding the area around Lychee Bay,

350
20:28.480 --> 20:30.680
what other plans do you have?

351
20:30.680 --> 20:32.000
As for specific projects,

352
20:32.000 --> 20:34.120
you'll have to wait for our official documents.

353
20:34.120 --> 20:35.159
I see.

354
20:35.159 --> 20:38.279
I believe this area will attract a lot of foot traffic.

355
20:38.279 --> 20:40.920
So, what are the future plans for Lychee Bay?

356
20:40.920 --> 20:42.799
The future?

357
20:44.319 --> 20:46.440
- I think... - Luckily, not many people come here.

358
20:46.440 --> 20:48.119
In the future, Lychee Bay can be developed

359
20:48.119 --> 20:51.759
into a "slow living" space in Macau.

360
20:51.759 --> 20:52.960
It can provide residents and tourists

361
20:52.960 --> 20:55.720
with a high-quality cultural venue.

362
21:00.440 --> 21:02.160
Chen Wan.

363
21:02.160 --> 21:04.400
Do you know where my watch is?

364
21:04.400 --> 21:05.799
Why is he asking him where his watch is?

365
21:05.799 --> 21:07.430
What's their relationship?

366
21:11.240 --> 21:13.039
You might have left it in the car.

367
21:13.039 --> 21:14.640
Wait a moment, I'll go look for it.

368
21:14.640 --> 21:16.140
Okay.

369
21:30.960 --> 21:32.119
Zhao Sheng Ge.

370
21:32.119 --> 21:33.279
Chen Wan.

371
21:33.279 --> 21:34.680
Who am I to you?

372
21:34.680 --> 21:36.319
You are the most important person to me.

373
21:36.319 --> 21:37.319
How important?

374
21:37.319 --> 21:39.360
Will you tell me everything?

375
21:39.360 --> 21:40.480
What are you thinking right now?

376
21:40.480 --> 21:41.599
Tell me.

377
21:41.599 --> 21:43.440
I want...

378
21:43.440 --> 21:44.799
What else do you want?

379
21:44.799 --> 21:46.799
I want you.

380
22:02.640 --> 22:06.640
Whatever you want, I will give it to you.

381
22:06.640 --> 22:09.480
- Zhao Sheng Ge. - Does it feel good?

382
22:09.480 --> 22:14.021
I can... lift a bit higher.

383
22:23.840 --> 22:24.879
I understand.

384
22:24.879 --> 22:26.480
I'm coming over now.

385
22:35.960 --> 22:38.440
It's so late. Where are you going?

386
22:40.880 --> 22:42.319
I have work to do.

387
22:42.319 --> 22:43.839
Then be safe.

388
22:43.839 --> 22:45.640
Watch out for paparazzi downstairs.

389
22:45.640 --> 22:47.599
Do you want me to drive you?

390
22:50.599 --> 22:52.640
Chen Wan.

391
22:52.640 --> 22:54.720
You can still stand up?

392
22:58.319 --> 23:00.359
Chen Wan.

393
23:00.359 --> 23:03.079
Do you want to have a secret affair with me?
